<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in tyre maker Debica closed higher and food trader Rolimpex was flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade. BIG, BPH and Elektrim did not trade on Thursday.</p>
<p>Total turnover amounted to 87,900 zlotys after none of the stocks was traded on Wednesday.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 2.9 percent to 89.50 zlotys in 0.6-million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
